inaccessible systems can create

00:02:35.523 --> 00:02:37.780
barriers to even the simplest tasks.

00:02:39.834 --> 00:02:43.702
That experience led her to work in
accessibility and community building,

00:02:44.551 --> 00:02:48.892
including her role as co-organizer of
Accessibility Talks, a monthly event

00:02:49.214 --> 00:02:51.393
dedicated to digital accessibility.

00:02:53.336 --> 00:02:56.735
She helps communities discover
how they can contribute and

00:02:56.736 --> 00:02:58.580
belong in more ways than code.

00:03:00.253 --> 00:03:05.069
She also is known for her superpower,
making any meeting twenty percent

00:03:05.073 --> 00:03:06.755
more awkward just by showing up.

